msgid ""
"The `Emlid Edge <https://emlid.com/edge/>`__ is an advanced autopilot with "
"HDMI video input and 5.8 GHz data link which allows full HD video streaming "
"and telemetry up to 2 km.  Dual temperature-controlled IMUs, external "
"DroneCAN GNSS module and a wide range power module based on Hall sensor."
msgstr ""
"`Emlid Edge <https://emlid.com/edge/>`__ 是一款先进的飞控，配备 HDMI 视频输入和 5.8GHz "
"数据链路，支持最远 2km 的全高清视频流和数传。双路温度控制 IMU、外置 DroneCAN GNSS 模块以及基于霍尔传感器的宽范围电源模块。"

